ous hormone(s), have a self-reported regular menstrual cycle defined as having a minimum of 21 days and a maximum of 36 days between menses\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"AND\": {\n                                            \"left\": {\n                                              \"raw_text\": \"8. Upon pelvic/speculum examination and colposcopy at the time of enrollment, the cervix and vagina appear normal as determined by the investigator\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"AND\": {\n                                                \"raw text\": \"9. Asymptomatic for genital infections at the time of enrollment\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"AND\": {\n                                                    \"raw text\": \"10. Willing to refrain from use of vaginal products or objects within 14 days prior to enrollment and for the duration of the study\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"AND\": {\n                                                        \"raw text\": \"11. Willing to answer acceptability and adherence questionnaires throughout the study\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                          \"AND\": {\n                                                            \"raw text\": \"12. Willing to refrain from participation in any other research study for the duration of this study\"\n                               